data/node/deprecated-api.json was written for this pack: the Node.js APIs that
the Node.js documentation deprecates (https://nodejs.org/api/deprecations.html),
each with its documented replacement, in codelaw's own words. No text or code
is copied from Node.js.

data/react/dom-property-aliases.json was written for this pack: HTML attribute
names and the React DOM prop names that replace them (`class` -> `className`),
as React documents them. No React code is included.

The rules are reimplementations written for codelaw. Their `ported_from:`
fields name the ESLint rules (https://eslint.org, MIT License) whose documented
behaviour they reproduce; no ESLint code or documentation text is included.
